<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-HANOVER GRAND PRIX WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HANOVER GRAND PRIX WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results at</p>
<p>$450,000 Hanover Grand Prix women's tennis tournament on Tuesday</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Dominique van Roost (Belgium) beat Denisa Chladkova (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 7-6 (7-4) 4-6 6-3</p>
<p>8-Yelena Likhovtseva (Russia) beat Nathalie Tauziat (France)</p>
<p>4-6 7-6 (8-6) 6-2</p>
<p>Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat Barbara Rittner (Germany) 4-6</p>
<p>6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Asa Carlsson (Sweden) beat Flora Perfetti (Italy) 3-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-4</p>
<p>5-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) beat Florencia Labat</p>
<p>(Argentina) 6-4 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Anne-Gaelle Sidot (France) beat Christina Singer (Germany) 7-6</p>
<p>(9-7) 6-2</p>
<p>7-Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) beat Katarina Studenikova</p>
<p>(Slovakia) 6-2 6-3</p>
</text>
